The original HarmonyOS WireGuard client implementation and its historical
contributions remain the work of the upstream author and contributors.

This public version adds and documents HarmonyOS API 23 adaptations for native
TUN polling and I/O, RouteInfo construction, native UDP transport, packet
ordering, and VpnExtension lifecycle handling. These adaptations are continued
work built on the upstream project's results and do not replace its attribution.

